        "text": "<p><strong>Less than 1 percent </strong>of the earth’s freshwater is accessible and <strong>over three billion people </strong>globally are at risk of disease because of unknown water quality. Almost <strong>all of UK waters are polluted and almost a third of Europe’s </strong>groundwater bodies are significantly affected by pollution.</p><p>Tap water can be contaminated by heavy metals, pesticides, chlorine byproducts, industrial pollutants and more - compromising its quality, taste, and impact on our health.<strong>We’re here to change that</strong>.</p>",
